ARC or PLC in Washington County","/arc-plc/new-york/washington-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids April to May and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years. In 2025, on the county&rsquo;s middle value, July to August came in at 51% of normal and August to September at 56%. Grid 27526 had its driest year in 1964 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
